1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:09,000
October 1962.
Trapped under heavy depth charges,
Soviet sub B-59 lost all contact.

2
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:18,500
Convinced World War 3 started,
two officers voted to launch nukes.
One man said NO.

3
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:29,200
Vasili Arkhipov vetoed the strike.
The submarine surfaced peacefully,
saving human civilization.
